    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BULLEZINE IS A 2D ADVENTURE ROGUELITE</h2>In Bullezine, you guide Luna, the queen of Bullezine, to save her people from &quot;oblivion.&quot; Inspired by classic roguelites, Bullezine aims to be a simplified and accessible version of the genre for a wider audience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bullezine collection</h2>As you embark on your adventures, you'll rescue Bullezine with different characteristics and rarities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack customization</h2>You can modify your creatures' attacks to give them devastating effects: poison, explosion, life leech... Choose what will be most effective for your team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World map</h2>Progress through the world by choosing your path.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Events</h2>Various events with multiple choices will enhance your adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Unlock achievements to access new features and increase your power.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomization</h2>Thanks to the randomization of the map and Bullezine, each playthrough is unique and guarantees entertainment every time.",
